# Native projects are generated from app.json by `expo prebuild` (EAS runs it
# on every build). A committed android/ makes EAS skip that and build the stale
# copy instead — wrong architectures, missing app.json changes.
/android
/ios

# Firebase client config for Android push. Not a secret in itself, but it
# carries a Google API key that GitHub's secret scanning blocks on push.
# Builds still get it: .easignore leaves it in, or set the EAS file variable
# GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON (see app.config.js).
google-services.json
